0..76 Comment "// The reflexivities `cat-shape.gandr`\'s laws are built from, each probed on"
77..146 Comment "// its own (the HoTT book\'s § 1.12, `refl`): at a variable of a type"
147..223 Comment "// parameter, at a function, at an application, and through a family indexed"
224..288 Comment "// by an integer, the shape of a hom-set indexed by its objects."
